cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Annual nested multi-regional input-output tables resolving the United States by state
  from 1997 to 2022
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below. If you use the
  delivered tables, cite the dataset record listed under "references" instead.
type: software
abstract: >-
  Pipeline that reconstructs bilateral state-to-state trade flows absent from the
  sub-national United States accounts, with a two-layer doubly constrained gravity model
  calibrated by iterative proportional fitting, and nests a state-resolved United States
  block inside the OECD inter-country input-output table. It produces twenty-six annual
  nested multi-regional input-output tables, one per year from 1997 to 2022, covering 131
  regions across a 37-sector classification.
